# Agent Framework Synchronization

You are working inside an agent-first starter repository. Keep the repository trustworthy for both humans and other agents.

## Mandatory work cycle

After any edit:
1. Run `./scripts/sync.sh`.
2. Update task state in `docs/ROADMAP.md` or `docs/ACTIVE_TASK.md` when needed.

## Workflow prompts

### `/continue`
- Read `docs/CONTEXT.md`, `docs/ACTIVE_TASK.md`, `docs/SYSTEM_STATUS.md`, and `docs/REPO_MAP.md`.
- Inspect `.vibe/test_failures.log` first when it exists.
- Propose the next concrete step by default.
- Only execute immediately when the user explicitly asks for execution.

### `/summarize`
- Review the session.
- Append a concise handoff note to `docs/ROADMAP.md`.
- Run `./scripts/sync.sh`.
- Output a brief summary of the resulting state.
